  "title": "nettrace_3gpp_32_423: Fix beginTime attribute lookup on wrong XML node",
  "description": "The beginTime attribute belongs to the \\<traceCollec\\> element, not the \\<fileHeader\\> element.The code was iterating over cur-\\>properties (fileHeader) instead of fileHeader_node-\\>properties (traceCollec), so beginTime was never found.\n\nfix #21241\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Kiro)",
